{"path":"/zh/topics/","title":"专题","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-7b6a2752ad246510-1","revision":"7b6a2752ad24651095adeb54213f76f533a24a3815cc415a81235975444fe486","tag":"p","quote":"跨越多个模式的设计问题：模式选型、生命周期、人机协作、软件工程与运行验证。"},{"block_id":"adps-78dcf98efd230379-1","revision":"78dcf98efd2303790d20351b60d9cfb1bb301e793381de1fe35f3b680b2f1fe5","tag":"p","quote":"从业务约束选择模式，确定状态交接与执行顺序。"},{"block_id":"adps-8375509bdea59dcb-1","revision":"8375509bdea59dcb2c80c65fe8cb8bffecf3d002a4fc521a2757d22ba825860a","tag":"p","quote":"从场景、约束和认知需求开始，画出架构草图。"},{"block_id":"adps-fafa6a0c6bbecf00-1","revision":"fafa6a0c6bbecf000347608a125c731b25cd8f31578eecf8974c793f665789c8","tag":"p","quote":"知识问答、长程研究、代码维护与业务执行的组合示例。"},{"block_id":"adps-2fc70841927cfefc-1","revision":"2fc70841927cfefc87af66dba6441cfdf73b5566d58f3b6e3dfea0119dc766f7","tag":"p","quote":"用同一组任务比较基线与候选组合，检查约束和消融结果。"},{"block_id":"adps-e6dfbe8398f0039d-1","revision":"e6dfbe8398f0039d3bc88bad608619433101340b66f1b4a1bdb36195bb7eee6d","tag":"p","quote":"从项目中提炼共性，再补齐具体实现所需的差异。"},{"block_id":"adps-5665ca1de82f89f1-1","revision":"5665ca1de82f89f1b22eec1a47ffb7d06f2b1feb7c0f3d96bccd552a42df195a","tag":"p","quote":"设计、验证、运行与退役，以及各阶段的授权和人的责任。"},{"block_id":"adps-57e659afa937a362-1","revision":"57e659afa937a362dffc6f734dacca0951665422be3594e143441a2703e277ba","tag":"p","quote":"用版本和运行证据管理能力的登记、发布、复验与退役。"},{"block_id":"adps-93359a59f2e6c636-1","revision":"93359a59f2e6c63632319fe3948c6ddff4482f6306cb6d4d28c93ab4be48d08f","tag":"p","quote":"共同编辑、执行审批、人工接管与责任分配。"},{"block_id":"adps-fd627441ca12369f-1","revision":"fd627441ca12369f9202d86ecfe3c6de58f0e32e805c780ff4f66668d37ad3f7","tag":"p","quote":"自主权扩大时，工程平台和组织职责如何调整。"},{"block_id":"adps-579c79f36319857d-1","revision":"579c79f36319857da584d8037b94219a374cdeb2bbfd6e57aead5c073ca196a2","tag":"p","quote":"从规格与上下文到代码、业务系统改造和交付验证。"},{"block_id":"adps-e01696b8d3a4fc27-1","revision":"e01696b8d3a4fc27f34f0824f74927d1d00a12ddfd84d6dd62cd457f89804c43","tag":"p","quote":"规格、上下文、执行与反馈在研发流程中的配合。"},{"block_id":"adps-30d712c7c47391ec-1","revision":"30d712c7c47391ec1f592ca9ba64a75e3b198cbf3356983f1bcd04000541b980","tag":"p","quote":"客户不开放源码时，通过业务接口增加 Agent 工作流。"},{"block_id":"adps-13499285be54cb92-1","revision":"13499285be54cb92d77b0b08f8f5ae48c6ae1828b88355964465127eb297414d","tag":"p","quote":"检查结果是否正确，追查运行过程，并约束运行时行为。"},{"block_id":"adps-1c7a415a67a57ceb-1","revision":"1c7a415a67a57ceb0a4c39342813fb0f510f507812900d942f4a65791463c003","tag":"p","quote":"组合确定性测试、轨迹评估、外部验收与生产反馈。"},{"block_id":"adps-ce464fa8fe058983-1","revision":"ce464fa8fe05898347a47b6c6e3b6fe0c271bcd27612f5c18fee3aed72675d62","tag":"p","quote":"从运行轨迹、组件版本和外部结果定位问题，验证变更。"},{"block_id":"adps-0ae6431cac8e625e-1","revision":"0ae6431cac8e625e58476f7741335e6cd7292be4aaecee6d0f35b705d7026910","tag":"p","quote":"回调的执行顺序、幂等、失败处理与版本管理。"},{"block_id":"adps-d65b28ee090f3a33-1","revision":"d65b28ee090f3a337c0ed8919015504a01600db98c081e40dc9e3c669b79390b","tag":"p","quote":"从调度、隔离、通信、存储与回收检查 Agent 运行时。"},{"block_id":"adps-61d3a0f1cc538518-1","revision":"61d3a0f1cc538518f9aa8049912fc8443d571e21a09c269b124060b8b53cce4f","tag":"p","quote":"这些页面会在案例或研讨会累积到足够材料后再发布。"}]}
